#. module: s6r_hr_leave_only_hr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:s6r_hr_leave_only_hr.field_hr_leave_type__hr_only
msgid ""
"When enabled, this leave type is reserved for HR managers only and will not "
"appear in the employee leave request form."
